# This repo is symlinked into live harness config (see install.sh), so anything a harness or tool writes into a
# linked directory lands here. Everything below is machine-local or generated; shared config is committed.

# --- Secrets ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Config reads secrets through {env:VAR}; the values themselves stay out of the repo.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# --- Machine-local harness config for working in this repo -----------------------------------------------------------
# opencode's project directory: local overrides such as proxy routing, plus the deps opencode installs beside them.
.opencode/
# Claude Code's per-machine permission and skill overrides. The shared Claude config lives under claude/.
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Generated -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Plugin dependencies. A plugin's package.json and lockfile are committed.
node_modules/
# Backups install.sh --force writes beside a replaced target.
*.bak.*

# --- OS and editor ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
